meta {
  name: 02 Reset Patient Password
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/login-credentials/reset
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  **Staff action (business JWT).** Resets a patient's portal password back to the
  fixed temp password **`Password@123`** (bcrypt-hashed, `isTempPassword = true`),
  forcing a change on next login. Clears any lockout.

  Unlike **Issue Patient Credentials**, this **overwrites** an existing password —
  use for a staff-driven reset. Tenant + actor come from the JWT.

  Response `data`: `{ patientId, personId, loginIdentifier, tempPassword,
  credentialsAlreadyExisted }`.

  Note: for a staff+patient hybrid (one shared `PersonCredentials` row), a reset
  also changes the staff password — intended, since it is the same person/login.
}
